      <input type="range" id="inp-predspeed" min="2" max="8" step="0.1" value="4.6" />
    </div>
    <div class="hint">Le faucon poursuit l'oiseau le plus proche. Les oiseaux qui le perçoivent fuient ; les autres suivent leurs voisins. Une capture retire un oiseau de la nuée.</div>

    <div class="section-title">1. Comportements Collectifs (Fig. 3)</div>
    <div class="preset-grid">
      <button id="preset-swarm">A. Essaim (Swarm)</button>
      <button id="preset-torus">B. Tore (Milling)</button>
      <button id="preset-dynamic">C. Parallèle Dynamique</button>
      <button id="preset-highly">D. Hautement Parallèle</button>
    </div>
    <div class="hint">Changer de régime sans réinitialiser conserve l'historique structurel du groupe.</div>

    <div class="section-title">2. Mémoire Collective / Hystérésis (Fig. 4)</div>
    <button id="btn-hysteresis" class="btn-warn" style="width:100%;">▶ Lancer le cycle d'Hystérésis (ro : 1 → 4.5 → 1)</button>
    <div id="hysteresis-status" class="hint">Garde ra = 14 fixe. Lance l'environnement « Aucun », sans faucon ni obstacle.</div>

    <div class="section-title">3. Paramètres du Modèle (Table 1)</div>

    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Individus (N)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-N">100</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-N" min="10" max="150" step="5" value="100" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Zone de répulsion r<sub>r</sub> (zor)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-rr">1.0</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-rr" min="0.5" max="2.5" step="0.1" value="1.0" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Largeur d'orientation Δr<sub>o</sub></span><span class="val" id="lbl-dro">5.0 (ro=6.0)</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-dro" min="0" max="15" step="0.25" value="5.0" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Largeur d'attraction Δr<sub>a</sub></span><span class="val" id="lbl-dra">8.0 (ra=14.0)</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-dra" min="0" max="15" step="0.25" value="8.0" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Champ de perception α (°)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-alpha">270°</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-alpha" min="200" max="360" step="5" value="270" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Taux de rotation θ (°/s)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-theta">40°/s</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-theta" min="10" max="100" step="2" value="40" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Vitesse s (unités/s)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-s">3.0</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-s" min="1" max="5" step="0.1" value="3.0" />
    </div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Erreur gaussienne σ (rad)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-sigma">0.05 rad</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-sigma" min="0" max="0.20" step="0.005" value="0.05" />
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">4. Tri Spatial — Différences Individuelles</div>
    <select id="sel-sorting">
      <option value="none">Aucune variation (groupe homogène)</option>
      <option value="s">Vitesse individuelle (s)</option>
      <option value="rr">Zone de répulsion (rr)</option>
      <option value="theta">Taux de rotation (θ)</option>
      <option value="ro">Zone d'orientation (ro)</option>
      <option value="sigma">Erreur individuelle (σ)</option>
    </select>
    <div id="sorting-controls" style="display:none;">
      <div class="control-row">
        <div class="control-label"><span>Écart-type individuel (S.D.)</span><span class="val" id="lbl-sort-sd">0.15</span></div>
        <input type="range" id="inp-sort-sd" min="0.02" max="0.50" step="0.01" value="0.15" />
      </div>
      <div class="gradient-bar"></div>
      <div class="gradient-labels"><span>Faible (bleu)</span><span>Moyenne</span><span>Élevée (rouge)</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">5. Simulation &amp; Aides Visuelles</div>
    <div class="control-row">
      <div class="control-label"><span>Vitesse d'exécution</span><span class="val" id="lbl-simspeed">2.0x</span></div>
      <input type="range" id="inp-simspeed" min="0.5" max="10" step="0.5" value="2.0" />
    </div>
    <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-follow" checked /><span>Suivre la nuée avec la caméra</span></label>
    <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-trails" checked /><span>Afficher les sillages de vol</span></label>
    <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-plane" /><span>Afficher c<sub>group</sub>, d<sub>group</sub> et le plan frontal (Fig. 2)</span></label>
    <label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" id="chk-zones" /><span>Afficher zor / zoo / zoa sur un oiseau (Fig. 1)</span></label>

    <div class="action-row">
      <button id="btn-pause">⏸ Pause</button>
      <button id="btn-reset">↻ Réinitialiser la nuée</button>
